Package: taigikeyboard
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: TaigiKeyboard <info@taigikeyboard.tw>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://taigikeyboard.tw
Depends: fcitx5 | ibus, fontconfig, @SHLIBS@
Description: Taiwanese (Tâi-gí) input method — Fcitx5 addon and IBus engine
 台語齒盤: TL / POJ romanization in, Hanji and romanization candidates out,
 continuous multi-syllable typing, over the same engine as the iOS, Android,
 macOS and Windows keyboards. Ships the Fcitx5 addon (primary), the IBus
 engine, the dictionaries, four Han typefaces (SIL OFL) as fontconfig
 fallbacks and a GTK 4 / libadwaita settings window.
